<title>UK: Commerzbank set warrants on bund and bund future.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank set warrants on bund and bund future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG said it has issued 50 million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the 6.25 percent Bund and the DTB Bund future.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   28.OCT.96		  LISTING   FRFT, DUSS</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT		 EXERCISE PERIOD	STRIKE     ISSUE</p>
<p> 6.25 PCT BUND CALL  04.NOV.96-23.JUN.97  102.0 PCT  0.94 DEM</p>
<p> 6.25 PCT BUND PUT   04.NOV.96-23.JUN.97  101.0 PCT  1.84 DEM</p>
<p> BUND FUTURE CALL    04.NOV.96-15.JUL.97  101.04 PCT 1.26 DEM</p>
<p> BUND FUTURE PUT     04.NOV.96-15.JUL.97  97.04 PCT  0.88 DEM</p>
<p> BUND FUTURE PUT     04.NOV.96-15.JUL.97  99.04 PCT  1.59 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
